OL,3,GNEWSAFifty firefighters at large
OL,4,Afactory fire in Antrim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe roof of a factory building has
OL,7,Fpartially collapsed following a major
OL,8,Ffire in Antrim.
OL,10,FFifty firefighters are tackling the
OL,11,Fblaze at the Mivan facility on the
OL,12,FGreystone Road in the Ballycraigy area
OL,13,Fof the town.
OL,15,FIt is understood it is now under
OL,16,Fcontrol but operations are continuing
OL,17,Fto dampen down the area.
OL,19,FResidents have been advised to keep
OL,20,Ftheir windows and doors closed during
OL,21,Fthe operation which is expected to last
OL,22,Fmost of Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
